        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, etc., the plaintiffs appeal from an order of the Supreme Court, Suffolk County (Baisley, Jr., J.), dated July 31, 2012, which granted the motion of the defendants Tiro Restaurant Corp., Lela Realty Corp., and Ricci Restaurant Corp. for summary judgment dismissing the complaint insofar as asserted against them.",
